OL,3,AWho will be Robert Pattinson's 'Bond   
OL,4,Agirl' - and does the role need to      
OL,5,Achange?                                
OL,7,FAfter months of speculation, we finally
OL,8,Fhave a new Bond. The question now is - 
OL,9,Fwho will play Robert Pattinson's       
OL,10,Fleading lady?                          
OL,12,FWhat's clear is that Pattinson's       
OL,13,Fannouncement as 007 has completely     
OL,14,Fupped the game.                        
OL,16,FHe's one of Hollywood's biggest stars, 
OL,17,Fso all eyes are on Amazon MGM to see   
OL,18,Fwhether they go for an equally big name
OL,19,Fas a 'Bond girl', or if they'll take a 
OL,20,Fchance on someone a little less well   
OL,21,Fknown.                                 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
